# File Explorer right-click — same CTXMENU layout as HQ entity menus
# (khtpm_core_render.c kh_open_cli_io_context_menu, 2026-09-14) and
# piececraft pc_entity_ctx.sh Copy/Paste/Delete. Window is an entity.
# CUT/COPY/PASTE/DELETE/PLACE are bridged; manager owns the FS.
CTXMENU | Cut | CUT
CTXMENU | Copy | COPY
CTXMENU | Paste | PASTE
CTXMENU | Delete | DELETE
CTXMENU | Place | PLACE
CTXMENU | Cancel | CANCEL
